/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (MASA\072\040A\040Multiplatform\040Architecture\040for\040Sequence\040Aligners\040with\040Block\040Pruning)
/Author (Edans\040Flavius\040de\040Oliveira\040Sandes\054\040Guillermo\040Miranda\054\040Xavier\040Martorell\054\040Eduard\040Ayguadé\054\040George\040Teodoro\054\040Alba\040Cristina\040Magalhaes\040Alves\040de\040Melo)
/Subject (Biological\040sequence\040alignment\040is\040a\040very\040popular\040application\040in\040Bioinformatics\054\040used\040routinely\040worldwide\056\040Many\040implementations\040of\040biological\040sequence\040alignment\040algorithms\040have\040been\040proposed\040for\040multicores\054\040GPUs\054\040FPGAs\040and\040CellBEs\056\040These\040implementations\040are\040platform\055specific\073\040porting\040them\040to\040other\040systems\040requires\040considerable\040programming\040effort\056\040This\040article\040proposes\040and\040evaluates\040MASA\054\040a\040flexible\040and\040customizable\040software\040architecture\040that\040enables\040the\040execution\040of\040biological\040sequence\040alignment\040applications\040with\040three\040variants\040\050local\054\040global\054\040and\040semiglobal\051\040in\040multiple\040hardware\057software\040platforms\040with\040block\040pruning\054\040which\040is\040able\040to\040reduce\040significantly\040the\040amount\040of\040data\040processed\056\040To\040attain\040our\040flexibility\040goals\054\040we\040also\040propose\040a\040generic\040version\040of\040block\040pruning\040and\040developed\040multiple\040parallelization\040strategies\040as\040building\040blocks\054\040including\040a\040new\040asynchronous\040dataflow\055based\040parallelization\054\040which\040may\040be\040combined\040to\040implement\040efficient\040aligners\040in\040different\040platforms\056\040We\040provide\040four\040MASA\040aligner\040implementations\040for\040multicores\040\050OmpSs\040and\040OpenMP\051\054\040GPU\040\050CUDA\051\054\040and\040Intel\040Phi\040\050OpenMP\051\054\040showing\040that\040MASA\040is\040very\040flexible\056\040The\040evaluation\040of\040our\040generic\040block\040pruning\040strategy\040shows\040that\040it\040significantly\040outperforms\040the\040previously\040proposed\040block\040pruning\054\040being\040able\040to\040prune\040up\040to\04066\0565p\040of\040the\040cells\040when\040using\040the\040new\040dataflow\055based\040parallelization\040strategy\056)
/Keywords (24\040Feb\0402016\054\040Parallel\040Computing\054\040Pruning\040\050decision\040trees\051\054\040Dataflow\054\040Block\040\050data\040storage\051\054\040Xeon\040Phi\054\040CUDA\054\040University\040of\040Brasília\054\040Barcelona\040Supercomputing\040Center\054\040Polytechnic\040University\040of\040Catalonia)
